sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator screen
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant P as Plate
  participant K as Live camera
  Note over S,K: Robot is at spot 8, Plate step.<br/>The plate is fed toward fastening position.<br/>The live camera watches the feed<br/>and must see the plate arrive.
  S->>P: CMD_START (spot 8)
  P->>K: is the plate in fastening position?
  K-->>P: NO, plate is stuck (jam)
  P-->>S: FAULT (PLATE_NOT_ARRIVED), feed stopped
  S->>P: CMD_START (retry 1 of 2, feed plate again)
  P-->>S: FAULT (PLATE_NOT_ARRIVED)
  S->>P: CMD_START (retry 2 of 2, feed plate again)
  P-->>S: FAULT (PLATE_NOT_ARRIVED)
  S->>Op: ALERT: robot stopped. Spot 8, Plate, PLATE_NOT_ARRIVED
  Note over S: Stack light turns flashing amber, so the operator sees it from across the roof
  Note over S: Robot waits at spot 8.<br/>Nothing moves.<br/>Operator can watch the live feed.
  alt Operator can fix it
    Op->>S: RESOLVED (jam cleared)
    S->>P: CMD_START (resume same step)
    P->>K: is the plate in fastening position?
    K-->>P: YES
    P-->>S: DONE
    Note over S: Spot continues with the placement check
  else Operator cannot fix it (last resort)
    Op->>S: SKIP_SPOT
    Note over S: Supervisor logs the spot as skipped,<br/>then advances to the next spot
  end
